## Features
- 490 tips for a lush appearance;
- Highly realistic mixed foliage;
- Fire-retardant for added safety;
- Foldable base for easy storage;
- Perfect for festive indoor decor;

## Information
Holiday decorating can feel rushed when a sparse tree looks flat and setup steals your evening. This HOMCOM 6 ft Christmas tree transforms the mood with 716 branch tips, PE, PVC, and pine needle foliage for a full, lifelike appearance, while 63 white berries and 63 large berry ornaments add festive charm. A 3-section hinged trunk with auto-expand branches speeds up setup, helping your living room look beautifully decorated sooner.
